<p>
<m>\displaystyle{\left\lbrace\begin{array}{ccccc} {9}{r}\amp-\amp{4}{s}\amp=\amp{100}\\-{8}{r}\amp+\amp{4}{s}\amp=\amp{150}\\-{9}{r}\amp-\amp{3}{s}\amp=\amp{200}\end{array}\right.}</m></p>
<p>
<fillin characters="20"/>   </p>
