<answer>
<p><ul><li><m>\displaystyle{\left[\begin{array}{ccc} {9}\amp-{4}\amp{100}\\-{8}\amp{4}\amp{150}\\-{9}\amp-{3}\amp{200}\end{array}\right]}</m></li></ul></p>
